#!/bin/bash
# farfield os command reference
cat << 'EOF'
=== farfield os Help ===

Core
  ff-info                   System information (fastfetch)
  ff-update [--yes]         Update system (--yes: unattended, runs
                              under systemd-run so ssh drops can't
                              kill pacman mid-transaction)
  ff-help                   This reference
  ff-dashboard              Full ff-board in the current terminal
                              (ssh view; run inside herdr for a session
                              that survives disconnects)
  ff-board [panel]          Ratatui dashboard. No args = full board;
                              host|claude|net|disk|containers|status
                              (also cpu|mem alone) render one panel (the
                              kiosk runs six as sway grid tiles). q quits.
  ff-metrics-board          Container CPU/MEM sparklines + net rates +
                              host line (one-shot fallback)
  ff-status-board           Unified status board (one-shot fallback)
  ff-docker-status          Docker containers + pm2 processes (one-shot)
  ff-deploy <name> [ref]    git pull + rebuild a project under ~/projects
  ff-kiosk-restart          Gracefully restart the kiosk compositor
                              (swaymsg exit; getty autologin respawns it)
  ff-kiosk-shot [out.png]   Screenshot the kiosk display via grim
  ff-display [on|off|status|log [n]]
                              Kiosk display power, manual. A tap on the
                              dark panel wakes it; `log` shows the
                              journaled on/off transition history.
  ff-services-status        Caddy sites + service health (one-shot)
  ff-claude-stats           Claude Code session + token stats (one-shot)
  ff-project-init <path> [desc]
                              Bootstrap a project dir: git init + a
                              starter CLAUDE.md for agent-assisted work.
  ff-bootstrap              Interactive post-install wizard:
                              tailscale + claude login + optional
                              gh / cloudflared. Idempotent — re-run
                              any time.

System info / status
  ff                          fastfetch
  myip                        Public IP
  localip                     Local IPv4 addresses
  ports                       Listening sockets (ss -tulpn)
  system-status               System overview
  db-status                   PostgreSQL + Valkey status
  security-status             UFW + fail2ban + sshd
  port-check <port>           Check if port is in use

Caddy
  add-site <name> [port|dir]  Add site (port = reverse proxy, dir = static files)
  add-public-site <host> [port|dir]
                              Public site via the Cloudflare Tunnel connector
  add-preview-site <name> [port|dir]
                              Tailnet-private preview at <name>.$PREVIEW_APEX
  remove-preview-site <name>  Remove a preview site
  list-preview-sites          List preview handles
  remove-site <name>          Remove site
  list-sites                  List configured sites
  test-caddy                  Validate Caddyfile
  caddy-edit                  Edit Caddyfile
  caddy-reload                Reload Caddy
  caddy-restart               Restart Caddy
  caddy-logs                  Tail Caddy logs
  caddy-status                Caddy systemd + recent logs

PM2
  pm2-start <ecosystem>       Start PM2 app
  pm2-add-site <name> <port> <ecosystem>
  pm2-remove <name>
  pm2-restart <name>
  pm2-logs <name>
  pm2-status                  PM2 + Caddy sites

Kiosk dashboard (attached display)
  Auto-login + sway on tty1; tiles six ff-board panels in a 3x2 grid.
  On a touch panel: tap a tile to fullscreen it (back button top-left);
  the fullscreen OPS view has action buttons (two-tap confirm on the
  destructive ones). Edit ~/.config/sway/config to change behavior.
  Super+F                     Toggle fullscreen
  Super+Shift+R               Reload sway config
  Super+Shift+Q               Quit sway

AI / LLM (Claude Code on the host)
  Manage the box: ssh in, run `claude`. Auth once via ff-bootstrap
  (or `claude` → /login). Session stats: ff-claude-stats.
  Stack lifecycle (caddy + cloudflared):
    sudo systemctl status ff-stack
    cd /srv/stack && docker compose ps
    cd /srv/stack && docker compose logs -f caddy
    cd /srv/stack && docker compose pull && docker compose up -d --build

Python (uv)
  uv venv                     Create a virtualenv
  uv pip install <pkg>        Install into active venv
  uv tool install <pkg>       Install a Python CLI globally (~/.local/bin)
  uv run <cmd>                Run command in project env

herdr (persistent agent sessions — replaces tmux)
  t                           herdr — launch/attach the persistent session
  tn <name>                   herdr --session <name>
  ta <name>                   Attach to a named session
  tl                          List sessions
  tk <name>                   Stop a session
  herdr --remote <ssh-host>   Attach to this box from another machine

Docker
  dkr / dkc                   docker / docker compose
  dkps / dkpa                 docker ps / ps -a
  dki                         docker images
  dkex <container>            docker exec -it

Files
  ll / la / lt / lf           eza variants
  tree                        eza --tree
  cat                         bat
  e                           nvim
  mkcd <dir>                  mkdir + cd

Git
  gs ga gc gp gl gd gb gco    git shortcuts
  glog                        git log graph

Navigation
  .. ... .... ..... ......    cd up N levels
  -                           Previous directory
  cdp cdd cdt cdl cde         ~/projects, ~/Downloads, /tmp, /var/log, /etc
  up <n>                      cd up n levels (function)

Help search
  ff-aliases                fzf over aliases
  ff-functions              fzf over functions

Backup / scaffolding
  backup-system               Snapshot configs to ~/backups
  create-react-hono <name>    Scaffold React + Hono project

AUR (yay)
  yay-update yay-install yay-remove yay-search yay-info

Snapper (btrfs only)
  snapper -c root list                List snapshots
  snapper -c root create              Manual snapshot
  snapper -c root delete <N>          Delete snapshot N
  snapper -c root undochange A..B     Roll back changes between A and B
  snapper -c root status A..B         Diff snapshots
  Boot stuck after a bad pacman -Syu? Pick a pre-update snapshot from
  GRUB's "Snapshots" submenu.
EOF
